# #187: on the ground, full down held with the tilt modifier (LB in the script preset) is a tilt
# input: a never crouches, so no crouch cancel, and A gives the down tilt; b holds plain down,
# crouches, and its A is the same down tilt.
#! chat -dev quick pair Rifleman / Illidan
60 a press LB
62 a stick 0 -1
62 b stick 0 -1
100 a tap A 1
100 b tap A 1
160 a stick 0 0
160 b stick 0 0
162 a release LB
#! absent a 60-170 crouch 1
#! expect a 100-102 applied attack 1 style 8
#! expect b 62-64 crouch 1
#! expect b 100-102 applied attack 1 style 8
240 a press VIEW
310 a release VIEW
